WEBVTT

00:07.882 --> 00:13.642
Let's laugh and cry.
chanto waraimasho, nakimasho

00:14.142 --> 00:19.732
Subs originally by Froth-Bite
Manually retyped by #Retrofit@IRC.Rizon.Net
Raws by Darkside-Raws
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha

00:19.772 --> 00:28.322
Making matching memories with you...
anata to osoroi no omoide tsukuruno ga

00:28.322 --> 00:30.192
...is important.
daiji daiji

00:31.572 --> 00:34.122
Sometimes I become...
sunao ni narenakattari

00:34.452 --> 00:37.952
...almost dishonest and mean
ijiwaru shichaisouna hi aruno

00:39.452 --> 00:40.792
That's because...
sore wa...

00:42.792 --> 00:45.542
I love you and adore you,
daisuki de taisetsu de

00:45.672 --> 00:48.882
and I don't want to be apart from you.
hanaretaku nai sei nano nante

00:50.842 --> 00:51.842
That's the truth.
henne

00:54.392 --> 01:01.102
I just want to cuddle...
hontou wa itsumo nuku nuku shitetai

01:01.432 --> 01:03.442
...with you.
futaride

01:04.442 --> 01:10.152
So let's laugh and cry.
dakara waraimashou, nakimashou

01:10.822 --> 01:16.242
We need to keep our hearts warm.
kokoro no ondo wo atatame awanakucha

01:16.452 --> 01:24.752
The fate that made us meet...
anata to deaeta unmei ho subetega

01:24.752 --> 01:26.582
...is important.
daiji daiji

01:30.132 --> 01:31.952
Seika Festival
The 30th Annual

01:31.952 --> 01:33.702
Seika Festival?
Seika Festival
The 30th Annual

01:33.702 --> 01:33.802
Yes
Seika Festival
The 30th Annual

01:33.802 --> 01:34.582
Yes

01:34.582 --> 01:36.452
We are holding it on the next holiday.

01:36.452 --> 01:38.912
What's the Seika Festival?

01:38.912 --> 01:40.252
It's our school fesitval.

01:40.922 --> 01:44.042
There will be a lot of stores and lots of events.

01:44.042 --> 01:45.462
It'll be fun.

01:45.802 --> 01:48.972
So we wanted to invite you.

01:48.972 --> 01:50.262
Right?

01:50.262 --> 01:52.302
I'm fine.

01:52.302 --> 01:53.842
I'm bored anyway.

01:53.852 --> 01:55.602
We can go too?

01:55.602 --> 01:57.352
I can too?

01:57.352 --> 01:58.522
Me too?

01:58.892 --> 02:00.892
Of course.

02:00.892 --> 02:02.562
Shiratori-san, would you like to?

02:02.852 --> 02:03.522
Yeah.

02:03.522 --> 02:07.612
Shiratori-san, don't get mistaken for someone who would peek in the locker rooms again.

02:07.612 --> 02:09.322
It was you who...

02:09.322 --> 02:10.822
You did that?!

02:10.822 --> 02:12.112
No, I didn't!

02:12.112 --> 02:12.612
Trying to hide it makes it more suspicious.
No, I didn't!

02:12.612 --> 02:13.322
Trying to hide it makes it more suspicious.

02:13.322 --> 02:14.372
Pervert.
Trying to hide it makes it more suspicious.

02:14.572 --> 02:19.212
At the School Festival

02:23.332 --> 02:25.752
It's been a while since my last time at one of these...

02:26.802 --> 02:29.592
...but it's quite different.

02:29.592 --> 02:31.842
It makes my heart dance.

02:31.842 --> 02:33.882
It's like the festival at the shrine.

02:33.892 --> 02:37.602
It's pretty good for a high school festival.

02:37.602 --> 02:38.562
Yes.

02:40.062 --> 02:42.442
There are many shops, Mom!

02:42.442 --> 02:43.562
There are.

02:45.692 --> 02:47.062
Goldfish!

02:47.402 --> 02:50.572
Mom, scooping goldfish!

02:50.572 --> 02:51.522
It is.

02:51.522 --> 02:51.572
Swimming Club
Scooping Goldfish
It is.

02:51.572 --> 02:52.402
Scooping Goldfish
Swimming Club

02:52.402 --> 02:53.532
Do you want to try?
Scooping Goldfish
Swimming Club

02:53.532 --> 02:55.162
Scooping Goldfish
Swimming Club

02:55.162 --> 02:56.662
But...
Scooping Goldfish
Swimming Club

02:56.662 --> 02:58.582
Scooping Goldfish
Swimming Club

02:58.582 --> 03:02.042
OK, then you can play once for free.
Scooping Goldfish
Swimming Club

03:02.042 --> 03:03.352
Really?
Scooping Goldfish
Swimming Club

03:03.352 --> 03:03.372
Really?

03:03.962 --> 03:05.622
Thank you, Onee-chan!

03:05.632 --> 03:07.342
Staaaaare...

03:07.342 --> 03:09.882
Which one do I want?
Staaaaare...

03:09.882 --> 03:13.842
Staaaaare...

03:13.842 --> 03:15.022
Um, would you like to try too?
Staaaaare...

03:15.022 --> 03:15.472
Um, would you like to try too?

03:18.062 --> 03:19.852
Thank you, Onee-chan.

03:20.182 --> 03:21.852
O-Onee-chan?

03:23.642 --> 03:25.442
Tama! Kozue!

03:26.152 --> 03:27.812
Hey!

03:29.112 --> 03:31.442
You have a shooting gallery?

03:31.442 --> 03:32.442
Yup.

03:32.442 --> 03:34.022
Would you try?

03:34.022 --> 03:34.072
Shooting Gallery
5 arrow
300 yen
