Would you try?

03:34.072 --> 03:34.412
Shooting Gallery
5 arrow
300 yen
Get your cute
Plushie!!
Archery Club

03:34.412 --> 03:37.822
300 yen for 5 arrows?
Shooting Gallery
5 arrow
300 yen
Get your cute
Plushie!!
Archery Club

03:37.822 --> 03:40.162
Isn't that too expensive?
Shooting Gallery
5 arrow
300 yen
Get your cute
Plushie!!
Archery Club

03:40.162 --> 03:43.032
But the prize is really good!
Shooting Gallery
5 arrow
300 yen
Get your cute
Plushie!!
Archery Club

03:43.622 --> 03:47.542
Well, I will play once for the sake of my friend.

03:48.042 --> 03:49.422
Thank you!

03:49.422 --> 03:51.092
Good luck, Tamami-chan.

03:51.212 --> 03:52.672
Yes.

03:53.262 --> 03:55.302
Let's go.

03:56.132 --> 03:58.392
You're shooting all of them at once?!

04:01.662 --> 04:03.682
That's amazing, Tamami-chan!

04:03.682 --> 04:06.142
That's nothing special.

04:06.142 --> 04:09.562
Now, let's get this special prize.

04:10.402 --> 04:12.862
Um, Momono-san...

04:13.532 --> 04:14.652
Be quiet!

04:14.652 --> 04:16.902
But we better go meet the others soon.

04:16.912 --> 04:18.412
Don't distract me!

04:18.412 --> 04:20.992
I'm almost done.

04:23.912 --> 04:26.182
All right! All done!

04:26.242 --> 04:27.252
How's that?!

04:29.422 --> 04:30.672
It's no good.

04:30.672 --> 04:32.592
The tip of the leg is chipped.

04:32.592 --> 04:33.882
What?!

04:33.882 --> 04:35.632
Don't be so picky!

04:35.632 --> 04:38.092
This should be within the allowable quality!

04:38.092 --> 04:40.222
I can't accept that.

04:43.222 --> 04:45.022
There you are.

04:45.682 --> 04:47.852
Let's go inside.

04:47.852 --> 04:48.152
You're trying to tell me that I have bad eyes?!

04:48.152 --> 04:48.942
Yeah.
You're trying to tell me that I have bad eyes?!

04:48.942 --> 04:49.732
You're trying to tell me that I have bad eyes?!

04:49.732 --> 04:51.362
Kozue-chan, what's that?
You're trying to tell me that I have bad eyes?!

04:51.362 --> 04:51.592
You're trying to tell me that I have bad eyes?!

04:51.592 --> 04:51.982
It's Don To Koi.
You're trying to tell me that I have bad eyes?!

04:51.982 --> 04:52.962
I'll teach you a lesson!
It's Don To Koi.

04:52.962 --> 04:54.092
I'll teach you a lesson!

04:54.152 --> 04:56.532
Tamami-chan got it for me.

04:56.532 --> 04:59.112
Isn't it cute?

04:59.112 --> 05:04.032
It makes me happy to see you so happy.

05:04.042 --> 05:05.042
We're here too.

05:05.502 --> 05:08.412
Hey, Onii-chan, look look!

05:08.422 --> 05:10.922
They gave me one for trying!

05:10.922 --> 05:12.792
That's great, Asami-chan!

05:12.792 --> 05:13.292
Yeah!

05:14.002 --> 05:15.052
Me too.

05:15.382 --> 05:18.672
<i>Is that something worthy of being glad to have?</i>

05:19.092 --> 05:19.972
Do you want it?

05:19.972 --> 05:21.182
No.

05:28.642 --> 05:31.652
You have shops like a real festival outside,

05:31.652 --> 05:34.272
and you have plenty of academic displays too.

05:34.612 --> 05:37.482
Water quality report, land quality report.

05:37.492 --> 05:42.412
political polls, planetarium, miniature model of the town...

05:42.412 --> 05:44.662
They all seem downbeat.

05:44.662 --> 05:47.162
You're just too uppity.

05:48.662 --> 05:51.542
Isn't there anything fun?

05:56.462 --> 06:02.762
Super spectacle suspense romance adventure cyberpunk horror masterpiece!

06:02.762 --> 06:05.222
Oh, come on!

06:05.222 --> 06:07.812
That's a really tasty catch phrase.

06:07.812 --> 06:11.522
The picture is great too, guaranteed to be a bad movie!

06:11.522 --> 06:13.272
Momono-san, what's going on?

06:13.542 --> 06:14.922
Let's watch this!

06:14.922 --> 06:16.522
Let's! Let's!

06:20.612 --> 06:23.662
Gao! Gao!

06:23.662 --> 06:25.412
Help!

06:25.412 --> 06:26.742
Bad monster!

06:26.742 --> 06:27.622
Die!

06:28.252 --> 06:29.412
I give up.

06:29.412 --> 06:30.582
I love you.

06:31.352 --> 06:32.582
I love you too.

06:43.012 --> 06:45.262
It was an extraordinary movie in a sense.

06:45.262 --> 06:48.432
I'm glad it had a happy ending.

06:48.432 --> 06:49.772
Yes.

06:51.432 --> 06:55.772
All the evilness was sucked out of my insides.

06:55.772 --> 06:59.732
Momo-san, how are you going to pay for this?

06:59.732 --> 07:03.532
I want this video, and I'll take the pamphlet too!

07:03.532 --> 07:05.492
What? Did you say something?

07:13.772 --> 07:17.232
Literature Club

07:26.472 --> 07:28.262
Do you like them?

07:31.852 --> 07:33.352
Literature is great.

07:33.692 --> 07:35.522
I'm glad I'm in the literary world.

07:35.852 --> 07:38.732
Do you happen to be a novelist?

07:40.482 --> 07:43.992
I just showed him the novelist primer.

07:49.162 --> 07:51.542
We haven't been to this area yet.

07:51.542 --> 07:53.502
Then let's go there!

07:58.792 --> 08:00.382
Everyone,

08:01.002 --> 08:03.092
we're in the haunted house.

08:03.092 --> 08:05.132
Please come visit.

08:07.392 --> 08:09.762
Um, you can stop by on your way back.

08:12.102 --> 08:13.972
What the heck was that?

08:14.812 --> 08:17.812
You're in the occult club, right, Tamami-chan?

08:17.812 --> 08:19.612
Do you know them?

08:19.612 --> 08:20.402
No.

08:20.402 --> 08:22.402
Why?

08:22.402 --> 08:27.202
I thought the haunted house might be done by the occult club.

08:27.202 --> 08:29.702
How biased.

08:31.492 --> 08:34.412
Long time no see, everyone.

08:34.412 --> 08:38.712
Welcome to the fortuneteller house operated by the occult club.

08:39.882 --> 08:41.862
We didn't come here for that.

08:41.872 --> 08:42.342
Occult Lab

08:42.342 --> 08:46.972
Member Tamami, a job well-done on bringing customers.
Occult Lab

08:46.972 --> 08:50.802
Like I said, we're not here for you!
Occult Lab

08:50.802 --> 08:50.852
Occult Lab

08:50.852 --> 08:51.592
Let's leave here at once.
Occult Lab

08:51.592 --> 08:53.562
Let's leave here at once.

08:53.562 --> 08:56.932
What are you saying, Member Tamami?

08:57.232 --> 09:02.022
Welcome to the occult club's fortuneteller house, everyone.

09:02.022 --> 09:06.612
The heck with your welcome, you masochist fortune teller!

09:07.152 --> 09:09.202
Spartan maniac!

09:09.202 --> 09:10.072
Cheapskate!

09:10.072 --> 09:10.702
Miss Pea, are you interested?
Cheapskate!

09:10.702 --> 09:13.742
Miss Pea, are you interested?

09:13.742 --> 09:14.872
Yes...

09:15.372 --> 09:18.372
Then I'll tell your fortune.

09:18.372 --> 09:20.712
Thank you...

09:20.712 --> 09:21.962
Asami!

09:28.422 --> 09:29.802
I see.

09:31.762 --> 09:32.972
How does it look?

09:34.852 --> 09:36.352
Miss Pea.

09:36.352 --> 09:41.352
...this is the card that signifies you; Temperance XIV.

09:42.692 --> 09:46.692
Temperance XIV signifies moderation.

09:46.692 --> 09:47.862
Moderation...

09:48.192 --> 09:53.322
This is the card that teaches the appreciation for matters.

09:53.322 --> 09:58.542
Looks like you are a modest, humble person.

09:58.542 --> 10:00.372
And as for your future,

10:00.372 --> 10:04.632
complicated human relationships, sudden changes,

10:04.632 --> 10:08.552
and mistakes made in love are being shown.

10:09.722 --> 10:11.552
I don't get it.

10:11.552 --> 10:14.432
You are Pea, so you don't get it.

10:15.812 --> 10:17.562
That's so funny!

10:18.932 --> 10:20.182
<i>She liked it.</i>

10:20.732 --> 10:22.392
The cat lays down.

10:24.022 --> 10:25.732
Not answering the phone.

10:26.402 --> 10:27.572
So good!

10:30.572 --> 10:34.412
Member Tamami, may I keep her?

10:35.492 --> 10:36.662
Go ahead.

10:36.662 --> 10:38.202
No!

10:38.492 --> 10:41.252
Then you come next.

10:50.092 --> 10:54.632
The card that signified you is Death XIII.

10:54.642 --> 10:57.642
It signifies the stoppage of everything.

10:57.642 --> 10:59.432
As for your future,

10:59.852 --> 11:01.432
the hands from the darkness,

11:01.732 --> 11:04.442
the unavoidable force,

11:04.442 --> 11:07.232
and irreparable remorse.

11:07.232 --> 11:09.442
There are more.

11:09.442 --> 11:11.322
The overwhelming poerlessness,

11:11.322 --> 11:13.242
the misunderstanding,

11:13.242 --> 11:15.202
the time of decision,

11:15.202 --> 11:16.112
that's it.

11:18.702 --> 11:19.532
She's not here.

11:23.872 --> 11:27.422
What kind of fearful future awaits you?

11:29.382 --> 11:30.382
No!

11:33.132 --> 11:36.552
My fortune-telling is getting very good.

11:37.302 --> 11:38.932
Mom!

11:39.512 --> 11:40.722
Asami...

11:40.722 --> 11:41.422
Oh?
Asami...

11:41.422 --> 11:41.602
Oh?

11:43.392 --> 11:47.102
Since you have many guests, we'll go now.

11:47.692 --> 11:49.862
Let's go, everyone.

11:49.862 --> 11:53.822
Member Tamami, stay here and help me.

11:53.822 --> 11:55.322
No.

11:55.322 --> 11:57.612
Then my inactive member...

11:58.202 --> 12:00.742
If I can be of any help...

12:00.742 --> 12:02.452
Not her!

12:02.452 --> 12:05.162
I won't let you have Kozue-chan!

12:06.462 --> 12:07.962
This means trouble.

12:07.962 --> 12:10.382
What shall we do?

12:12.512 --> 12:13.302
I'll do it.

12:13.512 --> 12:14.382
Yes?

12:14.382 --> 12:16.672
I will help.

12:16.972 --> 12:18.552
But...

12:19.102 --> 12:19.932
It's okay.

12:21.222 --> 12:25.232
I want you to enjoy the festival.

12:25.232 --> 12:27.142
But then you can't...

12:27.142 --> 12:28.562
I will be fine.

12:28.562 --> 12:31.192
I'll finish it quickly and catch up with you.

12:31.192 --> 12:33.112
So, please go.

12:34.652 --> 12:36.532
Then see you later.

12:36.532 --> 12:38.992
Yes!

12:49.422 --> 12:52.422
Your class has the arts and crafts display.

12:52.422 --> 12:54.382
And it works as a rest area too.

12:56.632 --> 12:58.552
There is Kozue-chan's work.

12:59.762 --> 13:02.762
Is this a raccoon?

13:03.312 --> 13:05.142
It's a lesser panda.

13:05.142 --> 13:07.732
Lesser Panda? This is?

13:07.732 --> 13:10.942
Nooo!

13:10.942 --> 13:12.692
Kozue-chan!

13:12.692 --> 13:14.232
What's wrong, Hiro-chan?

13:15.112 --> 13:16.782
Kozue-chan, what do I do?

13:16.782 --> 13:19.002
What should I do?!

13:29.481 --> 13:31.861
So, what happened?

13:31.901 --> 13:35.861
I am head of the symphony fan's association.

13:35.871 --> 13:40.121
Two of the members were injured during transportation of the stage props.

13:40.121 --> 13:43.411
They're being treated in the infirmary,

13:43.871 --> 13:47.581
but the nurse advised them not to perform today.

13:48.131 --> 13:50.921
That's unlucky,

13:50.921 --> 13:53.211
but you can't do anything about that.

13:53.221 --> 13:55.681
You have to do without them.

13:55.681 --> 13:59.241
No! We can't do that!

13:59.241 --> 14:00.181
Why?

14:00.181 --> 14:04.641
We're playing Mendelssohn's Violin Concerto!

14:04.641 --> 14:06.981
You mean those two play...

14:06.981 --> 14:09.611
They play piano and violin.

14:09.611 --> 14:11.361
Oh, man...

14:11.361 --> 14:13.491
Do you know that music?

14:14.241 --> 14:16.571
It's a really well-known piece.

14:16.571 --> 14:19.701
I'm sure you've heard it before.

14:19.701 --> 14:23.951
It's the most important day for the symphony fan's association.

14:24.371 --> 14:26.371
No!

14:26.371 --> 14:28.041
Kozue-chan! Do you know anybody?!

14:28.041 --> 14:29.381
Anybody who can play piano?!

14:30.881 --> 14:35.261
Piano might be easy, but a violinist wouldn't be easy...

14:35.261 --> 14:35.881
Here...
Piano might be easy, but a violinist wouldn't be easy...

14:35.881 --> 14:36.931
Here...

14:39.221 --> 14:40.891
S-Sayo-chan?

14:40.891 --> 14:42.181
It's the violin we're talking about...

14:49.231 --> 14:52.941
Mom, can you play the violin?

14:57.741 --> 14:59.741
Hey, we are saved!

14:59.741 --> 15:00.701
You mean...

15:00.701 --> 15:01.991
...you found people?!

15:02.411 --> 15:05.121
Thank goodness!

15:05.121 --> 15:08.001
So who is the one you found?

15:08.001 --> 15:10.171
Here...

15:14.171 --> 15:16.881
Hiro-san, let's give up.

15:16.881 --> 15:19.181
We weren't lucky this year.

15:19.681 --> 15:21.551
What are you saying?!

15:21.551 --> 15:24.261
If we don't perform this year, we won't get any new members,

15:24.271 --> 15:26.101
and will stay a fan's association!

15:26.101 --> 15:27.311
But...

15:27.311 --> 15:28.431
Don't give up!

15:28.851 --> 15:31.521
We swore against the setting sun...

15:31.521 --> 15:34.941
...that we will work to spread our love of the symphony!

15:34.941 --> 15:36.781
That's right!

15:36.781 --> 15:39.491
We sure did!

15:39.491 --> 15:43.741
Hey, you said, symphony fan's association, right?

15:43.741 --> 15:44.331
Yes!

15:44.331 --> 15:46.451
We three are the whole club!

15:47.041 --> 15:48.161
I play the piano.

15:48.751 --> 15:50.041
I play the violin.

15:50.961 --> 15:53.421
We're looking forward to having a full orchestra!

15:53.711 --> 15:56.251
What do you play?

15:57.171 --> 15:58.841
I'm the conductor.

15:58.841 --> 16:01.341
I can't do anything but swing the baton.

16:01.341 --> 16:03.221
Your direction is the best!

16:03.221 --> 16:06.061
I will follow your dream!

16:06.061 --> 16:08.101
<i>The only musicians are injured.</i>

16:08.101 --> 16:09.481
<i>At this rate...</i>

16:10.601 --> 16:14.311
<i>That makes Sayo-chan the only player...</i>

16:16.941 --> 16:20.321
Well, fine, I'll help too.

16:20.321 --> 16:23.241
Onee-san, can you play the piano?!

16:23.241 --> 16:25.581
Well, I used to play a bit.

16:26.161 --> 16:28.161
Please, we beg you!

16:28.161 --> 16:30.001
Please save us!

16:30.001 --> 16:31.291
You're so passionate.

16:31.291 --> 16:32.921
Well, fine.

16:32.921 --> 16:34.381
Yahoo!

16:34.381 --> 16:35.711
Momono-san!

16:35.711 --> 16:37.841
Momono-san, you play the piano?

16:38.921 --> 16:40.421
Well, yeah,

16:41.091 --> 16:43.051
although I don't have many good memories of it.

16:44.391 --> 16:46.721
Let me see the score.

16:46.721 --> 16:48.431
Yes!

16:54.771 --> 16:58.941
Hey, Asami-chan, it's impressive that Sayoko-san can play violin.

16:58.941 --> 17:00.941
I didn't know.

17:00.941 --> 17:02.201
O-Oh...

17:03.241 --> 17:03.491
Next up is the symphony fan's association.

17:03.491 --> 17:05.701
I wonder if she will be okay...
Next up is the symphony fan's association.

17:05.701 --> 17:06.831
Next up is the symphony fan's association.

17:06.831 --> 17:08.161
Mahiru Ojo-sama!
Next up is the symphony fan's association.

17:08.161 --> 17:08.291
We have some free seats here.
Next up is the symphony fan's association.

17:08.291 --> 17:09.581
The piece will be Mendelssohn's Violin Concerto in e minor, Op. 64.
We have some free seats here.

17:09.581 --> 17:10.701
Over here!
The piece will be Mendelssohn's Violin Concerto in e minor, Op. 64.

17:10.701 --> 17:14.631
The piece will be Mendelssohn's Violin Concerto in e minor, Op. 64.

17:15.291 --> 17:17.501
We formed the symphony fan's association...

17:17.501 --> 17:20.211
...to spread the joy of the symphony to more people.

17:20.211 --> 17:22.051
We were almost late.
...to spread the joy of the symphony to more people.

17:22.051 --> 17:22.131
Please enjoy our performance.
We were almost late.

17:22.131 --> 17:22.221
Please enjoy our performance.

17:22.221 --> 17:23.931
It's because you made us get lost.
Please enjoy our performance.

17:23.931 --> 17:24.391
It's because you made us get lost.

17:40.571 --> 17:42.571
There's my sister, Hiro-chan!

17:42.571 --> 17:43.951
Hiro-chan, go!

17:44.531 --> 17:46.821
They're wearing school uniforms!

17:46.821 --> 17:49.411
I guess they look like students that way.

17:49.411 --> 17:51.241
They look nice in them.

19:33.221 --> 19:34.971
Hiro-chan, you've done well.

19:34.971 --> 19:36.811
Very well.

19:51.571 --> 19:56.081
Man, I was really nervous on the stage.

19:56.081 --> 19:59.751
Anyway, I'm glad I didn't make any major mistakes.

19:59.751 --> 20:00.461
I know.

20:00.921 --> 20:03.881
Mom! Wow! That was really great!

20:03.881 --> 20:04.791
Really?

20:04.801 --> 20:06.461
It was wonderful!

20:06.841 --> 20:10.011
You were amazing!

20:10.011 --> 20:11.971
Who are you two really?!

20:11.971 --> 20:13.801
Are you famous?!

20:13.801 --> 20:16.061
I was so moved!

20:16.061 --> 20:17.181
Thanks...

20:17.181 --> 20:19.141
Can I call you Onee-sama?!

20:19.141 --> 20:19.851
I like Onee-chan better...

20:19.851 --> 20:20.731
Hey, Asami-chan,
I like Onee-chan better...

20:20.731 --> 20:21.311
Hey, Asami-chan,

20:21.851 --> 20:23.901
what do you think of us in these uniforms?

20:23.901 --> 20:27.021
Don't you think we can still look like high school girls?

20:27.031 --> 20:28.281
Yeah, you do!

20:28.281 --> 20:29.821
You're cute!

20:29.821 --> 20:31.901
Huh? I can't hear you!

20:31.911 --> 20:34.451
Momono-san, you are so cute!

20:35.951 --> 20:38.161
I know it! I know it!

20:39.581 --> 20:41.621
How would you like some cold tea?

20:42.711 --> 20:45.081
I want some cold beer.

20:45.961 --> 20:49.761
But a high school girl can't buy liquor!

20:49.761 --> 20:51.261
That's just a joke!

20:51.261 --> 20:52.681
Only a joke!

20:53.091 --> 20:55.801
That was really unexpected.

20:55.801 --> 21:00.181
There are still many things we don't know, even after living under the same roof for so long.

21:00.181 --> 21:01.391
I know.

21:01.981 --> 21:03.351
Here you go, Mom.

21:05.651 --> 21:07.441
I'm hungry.

21:12.651 --> 21:14.571
Ojo-sama!

21:15.661 --> 21:19.291
Isn't this great, once in a while?

21:21.451 --> 21:24.921
I could see an unexpected side of her at an unexpected place.

21:27.961 --> 21:30.091
Mom, working hard is great!

21:30.091 --> 21:30.631
That's right.

21:31.011 --> 21:32.421
Where is Mahiru?

21:32.421 --> 21:35.051
She is not back yet.

21:35.051 --> 21:35.931
Tachibana.

21:35.931 --> 21:36.391
Yes.

21:37.141 --> 21:39.471
Mahiru was trying to meet Sayoko, right?

21:39.971 --> 21:41.181
Um...

21:41.181 --> 21:44.441
She met Sayoko without letting me know, right?!

21:45.191 --> 21:45.981
Yes.

21:58.042 --> 22:04.552
One day, I drew a picture all over a canvas,
itsu no hika canvas ni e ippai

22:04.632 --> 22:10.352
a picture of 7-colored dreams.
nanairo no yume egaita

22:11.772 --> 22:18.232
When I noticed, I was a bit more grown up.
ki ga tsukeba sukoshi otona ni natte

22:18.482 --> 22:23.532
What have I found?
nani wo mitsuketandarou

22:25.492 --> 22:32.242
In this aimless daily life,
yuka ate no nai mainichi no nakade

22:32.492 --> 22:38.172
I found something that's most important.
ichiban taisetsuna koto ni kizuita

22:39.172 --> 22:45.012
Yes, it's always all right,
donna tokidemo sousa daijoubu

22:45.012 --> 22:47.262
because you are here.
kimi ga irukara

22:47.472 --> 22:53.642
Holding these unforgettable thoughts,
wasurenai kono omoi dakishimete

22:54.142 --> 22:59.982
I will start walking the path of the halted fantasy again,
mouichido togireta yume no fantasy

22:59.982 --> 23:04.612
at my own speed.
aruitemiyou boku no speed de

